  showNavigationButtons: 0
  pageText:
  - "Wendy- my tools are one thing, but Jessie\u2019s toys are another. I came down
    for water last night and nearly broke my neck trying to walk to the kitchen.
    To incentivize you\u2026 I locked the door to the basement and stuffed the key
    in that shape-hole toy. So, if you want to grab yourself a drink, you\u2019re
    gonna have to earn it."
